  <div>
    <div class="attr-pills">
      {# The three bosses span FIRE/LIGHT/DARK and Pyro/Thunder/Fiend, so
         there's no single attribute or type to put in slot 1 the way Mitsurugi
         and Fiendsmith do. It holds the joke instead (see hub.js), and gold goes
         to FUSION, the payoff, per the Scarce Gold Rule. #}
      <span class="attr-pill attr-violet">NOSTALGIA BAIT</span>
      <span class="attr-pill attr-teal">LEVEL 10</span>
      <span class="attr-pill attr-gold">FUSION</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Three gods too big to Normal Summon. <span class="wip-badge">WORK IN PROGRESS</span></h1>
    <p><a class="gold" href="{{ '/sacred-beasts/cards/' | url }}#uria" data-img="{{ '/assets/cards/sacred-beasts/uria.jpg' | url }}">Uria</a>, <a class="gold" href="{{ '/sacred-beasts/cards/' | url }}#hamon" data-img="{{ '/assets/cards/sacred-beasts/hamon.jpg' | url }}">Hamon</a>, and <a class="gold" href="{{ '/sacred-beasts/cards/' | url }}#raviel" data-img="{{ '/assets/cards/sacred-beasts/raviel.jpg' | url }}">Raviel</a>: three Level 10 monsters that can't be Normal Summoned, each fetching from a different card type when revealed in hand, and each feeding into <a class="gold" href="{{ '/sacred-beasts/cards/' | url }}#chaotic-phantasmal-sacred-beasts" data-img="{{ '/assets/cards/sacred-beasts/chaotic-phantasmal-sacred-beasts.jpg' | url }}">The Chaotic Phantasmal Sacred Beasts</a>, a 5000 ATK Fusion that shrugs off its first two destructions a turn and negates on demand.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
